														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2841926">
									

<p>This is a decent SCP. Short, simple, and not too boring. There are just a few minor changes I would like to recommend. First of all, in the containment procedures, you said &quot;T&quot;he room is to be equipped with lights capable of being dimmed by a simple, handheld remote, the possession of which will be given to SCP-3073 for it to use at its own discretion.&quot; This is a bit awkward to read, and may be better if you removed &quot;the possession of&quot; from it. Second, you referred to &quot;theater edict.&quot; I believe what you meant to say was &quot;theater etiquette&quot;.</p>
<p>Third, you indicated that it is fluent in all known languages. You may wish to shorten the list of languages it can speak to a list of its preferred ones, perhaps stating that it is fluent in English, French and German, as a humanoid that can speak all languages seems a bit overpowered.</p>
<p>Otherwise, this is decent. It's somewhat interesting, and it's short and simple enough that the concept doesn't get boring. +1</p>

							</div>

								
					
